; Room 21 ($15): Ballroom West
;
; Format: see #R$C000.
; .
; Border: blue (1). Conveyor: moves Willy right, 12 cells from row 13 column
; 16. Ramp: 4 cells from row 13 column 3 up to row 10 column 0, rising to the
; left.
; .
; Items (from the item table at #R$A400): 7, at row 12 columns 17, 18, 20, 22,
; 23, 25, 27.
; .
; Exits: left Room 22 (To the Kitchens    Main Stairway, #R$D600); right Room
; 20 (Ballroom East, #R$D400); up Room 27 (The Chapel, #R$DB00); down Room 0
; (The Off Licence, #R$C000).
; .
; Entities: slot 0: definition $21 (at $A108) start $18; slot 1: definition
; $28 (at $A140) start $0E; slot 2: definition $2A (at $A150) start $06. List
; ends at slot 3 ($FF).
@label=RoomBallroomWest
