 $D5F0 DEFB $21,$18 ; definition $21, start $18 (column 24)
 $D5F2 DEFB $28,$0E ; definition $28, start $0E (column 14)
 $D5F4 DEFB $2A,$06 ; definition $2A, start $06 (column 6)
